      <activity id="737c369e-a598-586d-9b1d-d561620eb9f6" activityNameId="a24330fb-6e7b-58a8-869d-2147fec593cb" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Roundwood, eucalyptus ssp. (SFM), under bark, u=50%, at forest road</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Roundwood, eucalyptus ssp. (SFM), under bark, u=50%, at forest road
data refers to wood from sustainably managed plantation. uses Dutch data on forestry processes;
Synonyms: Eucalyptus camaldulensis; 
UUID: 871817c2-cbed-3f06-8ea4-6b729c763a32
includes plantation establishment and management, harvesting and  hauling operations, incl biomass burning of branchings; fuel consumption and gravel for forest road construction is unknown; land use of forest roads and gravel are distregarded; branchings are left to rot on the ground
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: the representativity of this data set for forestry conditions in Thailand is assumed to be low
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: see Technology and Geography
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_871817c2-cbed-3f06-8ea4-6b729c763a32.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
